<node id="UPS">
  <data key="d0">UPS</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">UPS (Uninterruptible Power Supply) is a critical power backup system mentioned throughout the text, experiencing various issues like low battery voltage and high temperature.&lt;SEP&gt;UPS is a critical power supply device experiencing various issues like low voltage, high temperature, and short runtime.&lt;SEP&gt;UPS is an Uninterruptible Power Supply used within the smart park.&lt;SEP&gt;UPS refers to an Uninterruptible Power Supply system, managing power attributes and parameters.&lt;SEP&gt;UPS(不间断电源)是一种在市电断电时提供备用电源的设备，保护设备免受电压波动的影响。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1a3b82b8a933e988290cd564cc543305&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bcbcaac15fff56dfd6ef3e2d80be6e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c675720715b3a4d648f3507992c7cfb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad72853d1336affc17e16bb5a2152635&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e7dfd62344442735858b0c4c7806d7f</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
