</node>
<node id="冷源系统">
  <data key="d0">冷源系统</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">冷源系统is a chilled water system.&lt;SEP&gt;冷源系统是整个冷却体系，由冷水主机、调节阀、开关阀等组成。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0bcbcaac15fff56dfd6ef3e2d80be6e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0f0a9f0e5c0d9a8975dbf480856a029</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1757503265</data>
</node>
<node id="开关阀">
  <data key="d0">开关阀</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">开关阀is a valve that was initially found not working and was later repaired.&lt;SEP&gt;开关阀is an on/off valve.&lt;SEP&gt;开关阀是冷却系统中用于控制流体开关的部件。&lt;SEP&gt;开关阀用于控制冷水管路，其故障包括未关闭、漏水等。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6bc4d003d6ba779c2c7df3b4dd2d24d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bcbcaac15fff56dfd6ef3e2d80be6e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0f0a9f0e5c0d9a8975dbf480856a029&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-297c197d9d32841fe209492201961f9a</data>
