<node id="风机盘管">
  <data key="d0">风机盘管</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">风机盘管is a fan coil unit experiencing low wind speed, which is addressed by adjusting settings and replacing components.&lt;SEP&gt;风机盘管is a fan coil unit.&lt;SEP&gt;风机盘管refers to the fan coil units within the HVAC system.&lt;SEP&gt;风机盘管是空调系统中用于空气循环和温度控制的关键部件。&lt;SEP&gt;风机盘管是空调系统中的一个组件，用于控制室内温度。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1a3b82b8a933e988290cd564cc543305&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bcbcaac15fff56dfd6ef3e2d80be6e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-297c197d9d32841fe209492201961f9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-827dee305334229c2075f61b7b2e9105&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d6ae913c5a73fe76d98f6c2cdaa596e</data>
