<node id="冷冻水">
  <data key="d0">冷冻水</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">冷冻水is a cooling liquid used in the system.&lt;SEP&gt;冷冻水is the chilled water circulating in the system, also monitored for temperature during troubleshooting.&lt;SEP&gt;冷冻水是制冷系统中传递冷量的介质，用于冷却设备或环境。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-297c197d9d32841fe209492201961f9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1731340bf2ef4361c3277ed05457305d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3967c2a3f252eec14f07b945870ee934</data>
