<node id="冷却水">
  <data key="d0">冷却水</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">冷却水is a liquid used to cool the host&lt;SEP&gt;冷却水is the cooling medium used in the system, with temperature monitored during troubleshooting.&lt;SEP&gt;冷却水是制冷系统中用于散热的介质，吸收冷机产生的热量。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-297c197d9d32841fe209492201961f9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1731340bf2ef4361c3277ed05457305d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3967c2a3f252eec14f07b945870ee934</data>
