  <data key="d0">环境监测</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Environmental monitoring refers to the observation and tracking of variables like humidity and temperature.&lt;SEP&gt;环境监测is the organization responsible for monitoring environmental conditions within the building, such as temperature and humidity.&lt;SEP&gt;环境监测refers to the category of monitoring environmental conditions, such as humidity, temperature, and air quality.&lt;SEP&gt;环境监测refers to the category of systems and processes related to monitoring environmental conditions, such as temperature and humidity.&lt;SEP&gt;环境监测是监测环境参数(如温度、湿度)的系统。</data>
